      "message": "Without the EC/AP reset, there is a window between the completion of tpm_reset_now() (which calls if_start()) and the return from  tpm_reset_request().  If we don\u0027t want the AP accessing TPM after a wipe, then I think you need a new board_assert_ec_rst() function that handles the closed loop case.\n\nIf the EC/AP reset won\u0027t be done, then the comment needs to be updated.",
